## ==============================================================================
## web_banhang_be/ - .dockerignore
## Exclude files not needed in Docker build context
## ==============================================================================

## --- Build artifacts (rebuild inside Docker) ---
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/artifacts/

## --- Logs ---
**/Logs/
**/*.log

## --- Test projects (không cần trong production image) ---
**/tests/
**/*.Tests/
**/*.UnitTests/
**/*.IntegrationTests/
**/TestResults/

## --- IDE & Editor ---
.vs/
.vscode/
**/*.user
**/*.suo

## --- Git ---
.git/
.gitignore
**/.gitignore

## --- Environment & Secrets (inject via docker-compose) ---
.env
.env.*
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Production.json

## --- Scripts (chỉ dùng local) ---
*.ps1
*.sh

## --- OS ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

## --- Documentation ---
README.md
docs/
